### Withdrawal


# curl -X POST http://localhost:5144/api/withdrawals 
#  -H "Content-Type: application/json" 
#  -d '{
#    "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
#    "customerIban": "DE89370400440532013000",
#    "customerName": "Alice Muller",
#    "amount": 30.00,
#    "sepaType": 2
#  }'
